DELETE RESERVATION:
on list page.
---------------------------------------

CREATING UNIQUE IDS:
- our system shd produce the id (usually the primary key)
- in this p-roject since we are dont using db, we are doing it in addReservation using time.now()

EDIT RESERVATION:
    - {path: "edit/:id",component: ReservationFormComponent}
    - go to ngOnInit lifecycle hook and check if  we are at the edit endpoint so that we know we need to fill reservation form
    - Activated route has the values of the current route
    "import { ActivatedRoute } from '@angular/router';"
    - Fill the form if we have id param in route:
        let id = this.activatedRoute.snapshot.paramMap.get('id')
        if(id){
        let reservation = this.reservationService.getReservation(id)
        if(reservation)
            this.reservationForm.patchValue(reservation)
        }
    - call updte onSubmit
        let id = this.activatedRoute.snapshot.paramMap.get('id')
        if(id){
            this.reservationService.updateReservation(id,reservation);
        }else{
            this.reservationService.addReservation(reservation);
        }

--------------------------------
COMBINING COMPONENTS OF DIFFERENT MODUELS:
- import the module1 which contains the component that you want to use.
- allow that module1 to be imported by exporting it from its module
Home.module.ts:
    exports:[
    HomeComponent
  ]
reservation.module.ts:
  imports: [
    HomeModule
    ]